  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">Emission rewards are distributed at the end of every epoch automatically by the network protocol.</p><p id=\"\">As per the <a id=\"\" href=\"https://assets.website-files.com/6053f7fca5bf627283b582c2/6088147cbbc08674b4975349_Economic-2020-V10.4.pdf\">Radix Economic model</a>, 300m XRD are distributed per year, for 40 years, as staking rewards.</p><p id=\"\"><br></p><p id=\"\"><br></p><p id=\"\"><br></p>",
